    "speed": 1.06
  },
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "01-n_wake",
      "text": "Tuesday. Seven a.m. You open your eyes... and you know everything.",
      "file": "01-n_wake.mp3",
      "align": "01-n_wake.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.83,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 5.54,
      "hash": "f30c35328ccb2b56",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-n_room",
      "text": "Not most things. Everything. The spider in the corner is forty-one days old. There are two million specks of dust in that sunbeam. And your phone is about to buzz... now.",
      "file": "02-n_room.mp3",
      "align": "02-n_room.align.json",
      "seconds": 12.15,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 11.52,
      "hash": "b2eeb21ba89462f4",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-n_toast",
      "text": "Downstairs, Mom is making toast. Above the toaster, you can see a number. Ninety-four percent... burnt.",
      "file": "03-n_toast.mp3",
      "align": "03-n_toast.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.15,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.48,
      "hash": "e632158f485f5bbe",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-n_maya",
      "text": "Across the table, your sister Maya is texting. Over her head, you can read exactly where she was last night. It wasn't the library.",
      "file": "04-n_maya.mp3",
      "align": "04-n_maya.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.01,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 8.48,
      "hash": "cc30ad55763a5ffa",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-n_lesson",
      "text": "Lesson one. When you know everything... don't say everything.",
      "file": "05-n_lesson.mp3",
      "align": "05-n_lesson.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.09,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 4.38,
      "hash": "23deeb4c627b14c2",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-n_title",
      "text": "What if you suddenly knew everything?",
      "file": "06-n_title.mp3",
      "align": "06-n_title.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.72,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 2.2,
      "hash": "8f44bae9da2f6a92",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-n_walk",
      "text": "On the walk to school, it gets louder. Every car, every bird, every stranger has a story floating over it. Where they're going. What they're afraid of.",
      "file": "07-n_walk.mp3",
      "align": "07-n_walk.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.87,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 10.38,
      "hash": "933ac285dc5f3fdf",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-n_space",
      "text": "And it doesn't stop at the street. You know what's on the far side of the Moon. What's in the heart of the Sun. What's waiting at the edge of the universe.",
      "file": "08-n_space.mp3",
      "align": "08-n_space.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.2,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 8.52,
      "hash": "3cf8786e67ee4de4",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-n_hole",
      "text": "Scientists would call this impossible. Squeeze that much information into one head, and it should collapse into a black hole. Yours didn't. You know exactly why. There just aren't words for it yet.",
      "file": "09-n_hole.mp3",
      "align": "09-n_hole.align.json",
      "seconds": 12.85,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 12.44,
      "hash": "4ca1c3061edbea3a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "10-n_dice",
      "text": "But there are two catches. One: you can't see the future. Not exactly. Deep down, the universe rolls dice. So you see the odds. A kid kicks a can. Seventy-one percent... it lands in the bin.",
      "file": "10-n_dice.mp3",
      "align": "10-n_dice.align.json",
      "seconds": 14.55,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 14.02,
      "hash": "a9145567e864e9cc",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-n_mirror",
      "text": "Two: there's one thing you can't know at all. You. Everyone you look at has their next move floating over their head. Then you catch your reflection in a shop window. Over yours... there's just a question mark.",
      "file": "11-n_mirror.mp3",
      "align": "11-n_mirror.align.json",
      "seconds": 13.66,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 13.06,
      "hash": "616db75e9ffeae3c",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-n_test",
      "text": "First period. A math test. Twenty questions. You finish in forty seconds.",
      "file": "12-n_test.mp3",
      "align": "12-n_test.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.06,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 5.58,
      "hash": "c144bb4f28d34b21",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-n_lunch",
      "text": "It is. By lunch, the whole school is following you around.",
      "file": "13-n_lunch.mp3",
      "align": "13-n_lunch.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.39,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.98,
      "hash": "8c86e036c5c43e6c",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "14-n_learn",
      "text": "You're learning.",
      "file": "14-n_learn.mp3",
      "align": "14-n_learn.align.json",
      "seconds": 1.25,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 0.72,
      "hash": "bef602aeb3a3e6ec",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "15-n_dig",
      "text": "After school, you take Maya out to the backyard. You know something no one else alive knows. You start digging next to the old tree.",
      "file": "15-n_dig.mp3",
      "align": "15-n_dig.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.01,
      "speech_start": 0.14,
      "speech_end": 8.58,
      "hash": "6fffb7625150ea20",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-n_tin",
      "text": "Three feet down, there's a rusty tin. Inside: two hundred gold coins, buried in eighteen fifty-one by a farmer who never came back for them.",
      "file": "16-n_tin.mp3",
      "align": "16-n_tin.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.71,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 9.94,
      "hash": "573845ea660af219",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "17-n_viral",
      "text": "Maya was filming. By midnight, the video has forty million views.",
      "file": "17-n_viral.mp3",
      "align": "17-n_viral.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.36,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 4.78,
      "hash": "be19bd5800604f3b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "18-n_wed",
      "text": "Wednesday. There are news vans outside your house.",
      "file": "18-n_wed.mp3",
      "align": "18-n_wed.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.66,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.04,
      "hash": "cb32e1ac22a4118a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "19-n_thu",
      "text": "Thursday. A university lab. A physicist asks you the question she has spent thirty years trying to answer.",
      "file": "19-n_thu.mp3",
      "align": "19-n_thu.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.73,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 7.24,
      "hash": "1f4719e99b8f1130",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "20-n_marker",
      "text": "You pick up a marker. You write for six seconds. She reads it twice. Then she sits down... and starts to cry.",
      "file": "20-n_marker.mp3",
      "align": "20-n_marker.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.7,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 8.08,
      "hash": "4d4898cfe0e1137a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "21-n_fri",
      "text": "By Friday, you've written down the cure for three kinds of cancer. You're the most famous person on Earth.",
      "file": "21-n_fri.mp3",
      "align": "21-n_fri.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.87,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 6.28,
      "hash": "748f40d8b2725170",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "22-n_price",
      "text": "But it comes with a price. Nothing surprises you anymore. Every joke, you know the punchline. Every movie, you know who dies. That night, Maya gives you a present, to say thanks for not telling Mom everything else. And you already know what's inside.",
      "file": "22-n_price.mp3",
      "align": "22-n_price.align.json",
      "seconds": 16.54,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 15.98,
      "hash": "607fd84bdd8db56a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "23-n_night",
      "text": "And at night, the universe never goes quiet. Every heartbeat on Earth. Every storm. Every star dying, somewhere far away. You haven't slept in four days.",
      "file": "23-n_night.mp3",
      "align": "23-n_night.align.json",
      "seconds": 12.85,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 12.24,
      "hash": "835ee8625d3eac6a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "24-n_car",
      "text": "Saturday night, a black car stops outside your house. You knew it would.",
      "file": "24-n_car.mp3",
      "align": "24-n_car.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.17,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 4.7,
      "hash": "45dd638d6eaf355c",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "25-n_know",
      "text": "You look at her, and you know everything she knows. They don't want the cures. They want the secrets. And if you get in that car, you never come home.",
      "file": "25-n_know.mp3",
      "align": "25-n_know.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.9,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 9.44,
      "hash": "5820c6e54cdcbaf1",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "26-n_odds",
      "text": "Upstairs, you run every possibility. Run: caught, ninety-nine percent. Hide: found, ninety-eight. Go with them: you never see your family again.",
      "file": "26-n_odds.mp3",
      "align": "26-n_odds.align.json",
      "seconds": 12.15,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 11.64,
      "hash": "4591bf10967c8e13",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "27-n_forget",
      "text": "But there's one more way out. Of course there is. You know everything... including how to forget it. Every cure. Every answer. All of it, gone.",
      "file": "27-n_forget.mp3",
      "align": "27-n_forget.align.json",
      "seconds": 11.26,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 10.74,
      "hash": "14ae116b4a0431a3",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "28-n_comp",
      "text": "Outside, their computers say you'll get in the car. Ninety-nine percent. Nobody gives up knowing everything.",
      "file": "28-n_comp.mp3",
      "align": "28-n_comp.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.26,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 6.8,
      "hash": "8c730be13cc94313",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "29-n_first",
      "text": "And for the first time all week... you don't know what you're going to do.",
      "file": "29-n_first.mp3",
      "align": "29-n_first.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.62,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 3.94,
      "hash": "db5c406fb631d103",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "30-n_sun",
      "text": "Sunday. Seven a.m. You open your eyes. The ceiling is just a ceiling.",
      "file": "30-n_sun.mp3",
      "align": "30-n_sun.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.14,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 5.68,
      "hash": "bd3fc61050e1ed1f",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "31-n_burn",
      "text": "Downstairs, there's no number over the toaster. The toast burns anyway. And you laugh so hard, Mom thinks you're sick.",
      "file": "31-n_burn.mp3",
      "align": "31-n_burn.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.15,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.62,
      "hash": "ddadfeb02256741b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "32-n_gone",
      "text": "Outside, the black car is gone. They checked. You're just a normal kid again.",
      "file": "32-n_gone.mp3",
      "align": "32-n_gone.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.51,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 5.02,
      "hash": "ab4d3ae6ad98a29b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "33-n_note",
      "text": "But before you forgot, you wrote yourself one note. It's under your pillow. You haven't read it yet.",
      "file": "33-n_note.mp3",
      "align": "33-n_note.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.37,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 5.94,
      "hash": "aa562a02782e0b3b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "34-n_cta",
      "text": "What would you have written?",
      "file": "34-n_cta.mp3",
      "align": "34-n_cta.align.json",
      "seconds": 1.33,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 1.06,
      "hash": "21d80219099bd8ef",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    }
  ]
}
